# The Lost City, long after (mission.cop.the_lost_city#late). Sheltering Doubt current: 2-2 and Darkness Named are both
# completed, so section 2 (2-2 completed, Darkness Named not) does not apply. In Tavnazian Safehold Arquil and Despachiaire
# answer nothing from this mission (the events 292 and 108 are Sheltering Doubt's).
lists TavnazianSafehold/Arquil/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/Despachiaire/onTrigger
char zone=TavnazianSafehold pos=0,-22,10 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop ShelteringDoubt current
login
trigger Arquil                          # Darkness Named completed: nothing from section 2
finish-if-event
trigger Despachiaire                    # nothing from section 2
finish-if-event
